### Academic Attribution & Citation Notice

This software, embedded firmware, and FPGA RTL repository was designed and engineered as part of a Bachelor of Engineering (B.E.) Capstone Project and peer-reviewed research initiative:

* **Project Title:** Battery State Estimator: An ESN-Based Alternative to EKF and Coulomb Counting
* **Student Authors:** 
  - Sanjna Patankar (2023.sanjna.patankar@ves.ac.in)
  - Akshay Nambiar (2023.akshay.nambiar@ves.ac.in)
